---
description: >-
  Fills and label colours written as `rgb(…)` and `rgba(…)` (with and without
  blanks inside), the colour forms the lexer reads as one token each.
---
venn-beta
  set A["Alpha"]
  set B["Beta"]
  union A, B
  style A fill:rgb(255, 99, 71), color:rgb(120,0,0)
  style B fill:rgba(30,144,255,0.8), color:rgba( 0, 0, 90, 1 )
